## TARGET vs CURRENT CODE

- **TARGET:** Launch 14-day trial, then Starter / Growth / Pro / Enterprise, billed monthly / quarterly / yearly (user prices in `01-PRICING-CATALOG.md`).
- **CURRENT CODE:** old one-shot Razorpay Order — Starter (free) / Growth ₹3999 / Business ₹11999 / Enterprise; `activatePlan` ≈ now + 30 days. **Do not treat that as product truth.**

## Two ledgers (never mix)

1. **Samyoj SaaS** — Razorpay (INR). Plan price is software only.
2. **Meta Cloud API** — billed on the customer WABA. Never fold Meta message fees into the Samyoj plan price.

Meta facts: per-message pricing since **1 Jul 2025**; service messages paid from **1 Oct 2026**; India INR WABA migration by **31 Dec 2026**. Partner model: **Tech Provider**. Details in doc 17.

## Architecture (when asked to implement)

Razorpay **Subscriptions** collect SaaS fees. Samyoj issues **GST invoices** and owns entitlements/dunning. Meta bills the WABA. Two invoices, two ledgers.

Zero: do not ship the TARGET catalog into live plans/checkout until the user explicitly asks.
